      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/sutcliffe_nevada"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Sutcliffe evolved into a retreat for anglers seeking the Lahontan cutthroat trout found in the waters of Pyramid Lake.",
